From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luca Weiss <luca.weiss@fairphone.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Apr 2026 09:40:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: net: qcom,ipa: add Milos compatible

Add support for the Milos SoC, which uses IPA v5.2.

Acked-by: Krzysztof Kozlowski <krzysztof.kozlowski@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Luca Weiss <luca.weiss@fairphone.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260410-ipa-v5-2-v2-1-778422a05060@fairphone.com
Signed-off-by: Jakub Kicinski <kuba@kernel.org>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml
index 1109f4d17..ccb7eb315 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml
@@ -45,6 +45,7 @@ properties:
   compatible:
     oneOf:
       - enum:
+          - qcom,milos-ipa
           - qcom,msm8998-ipa
           - qcom,sc7180-ipa
           - qcom,sc7280-ipa
